```php
namespace Commerz\Catalog\Attributes\Contracts;

/** A data type of attribute values, contributed under kind `attribute_type`; stateless, pure, no IO. */
#[Spi(kind: SpiKind::Implement, since: '0.1')]
interface AttributeType
{
    public const string KIND = 'attribute_type';

    public function key(): string;                       // 'decimal', 'acme.color_swatch'

    /** Version of the config format this type writes; stored as attributes.config_version. */
    public function configVersion(): int;

    /** Whether definitions of this type own a list of choices (cmz_attribute_choices). */
    public function usesChoices(): bool;

    /**
     * Validates and canonicalizes a definition config (sorted keys, defaults filled).
     * @param array<string, mixed> $config
     * @return array<string, mixed> JSON-safe, no floats
     * @throws InvalidAttributeConfig
     */
    public function config(array $config): array;

    /**
     * Input (from a command, an import or its own stored form) → canonical stored value. Must be idempotent:
     * normalize(normalize(x)) === normalize(x). Never returns null or a float.
     * @return string|int|bool|array<array-key, mixed>
     * @throws InvalidAttributeValue
     */
    public function normalize(mixed $input, AttributeDefinition $definition): string|int|bool|array;

    /**
     * Facts of a canonical value for the filter projection.
     * @param string|int|bool|array<array-key, mixed> $value
     * @return list<IndexFact>
     */
    public function index(string|int|bool|array $value, AttributeDefinition $definition): array;

    /** @return list<FilterOperator> operators a filterable attribute of this type supports; [] = never filterable */
    public function operators(): array;
}
```

Публичные DTO (`Attributes\Data`, `#[Api]`): `AttributeDefinition(string $code, array $config, list<AttributeChoiceView> $choices)` + `choice(string $code): ?AttributeChoiceView`; `IndexFact` — приватный конструктор, фабрики `choice(AttributeChoiceId $id)`, `number(string $decimal)` (проверка `/\A-?\d+(\.\d+)?\z/`), `flag(bool)`, `day(string $ymd)`, `term(string $text)` (обрезка `mb_substr(…, 0, 255)`), ровно одно поле заполнено. `Enums\FilterOperator`: `Equals='equals'`, `In='in'`, `Range='range'`. Исключения: `InvalidAttributeValue(string $attribute, string $reason)` → `catalog.invalid_attribute_value`, Validation; `InvalidAttributeConfig(string $attribute, string $reason)` → `catalog.invalid_attribute_config`, Validation.

Встроенные типы (`Attributes\Internal\Types\*Type`, `final readonly`, вклад плагина `commerz.catalog`):

| key | config (канонический) | вход | хранимое значение | факты | операторы | choices |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `text` | `{maxLength: int 1..10000 = 255}` | string, не пустой после trim, `mb_strlen ≤ maxLength` | string как есть | `term` | equals, in | нет |
| `localized_text` | `{maxLength: int 1..100000 = 10000}` | `LocalizedText` или `array<locale,string>` (через `new LocalizedText`) | объект `{locale: text}`, `ksort` | — | — | нет |
| `integer` | `{min?: int, max?: int}`, min ≤ max | int или строка `/\A-?\d+\z/` в пределах int64; float/bool → ошибка | int | `number((string) $v)` | equals, in, range | нет |
| `decimal` | `{scale: int 0..12 = 2, min?: string, max?: string}` | numeric-string или int; float → ошибка; дробных знаков после `stripTrailingZeros` > scale → ошибка (без округления) | string `BigDecimal::toScale(scale)` (`'1.50'`) | `number` | equals, in, range | нет |
| `boolean` | `{}` | bool (строго) | bool | `flag` | equals | нет |
| `date` | `{}` | `'Y-m-d'` (проверка `checkdate`) или `DateTimeInterface` (`format('Y-m-d')`) | string `Y-m-d` | `day` | equals, range | нет |
| `enum` | `{}` | код выбора (string) из `definition.choices` | string-код | `choice(id)` | equals, in | да |
| `multi_enum` | `{}` | непустой `list<string>` кодов; дубли схлопываются | list кодов, упорядочен по `position`, затем `code` | `choice` на каждый | equals (содержит), in (любой из) | да |
| `measure` | `{unit: string (Unit::assert) — обязателен, scale: int 0..12 = 3}` | `Measure` или `['value' => numeric-string, 'unit' => string]`; unit ≠ config.unit → ошибка (конверсии нет); scale как у decimal | `{"unit": u, "value": toScale}` | `number(value)` | equals, range | нет |
| `reference` | `{refType: string [a-z0-9_.-]{1,64} — обязателен}` | `Commerz\Identity\Ref` или string `type:id`; type = refType; id 1..120 байт, без управляющих символов | string `type:id` | `term` | equals, in | нет |

Общие правила (в `DatabaseAttributes::define`, не в типах): тип с `operators() === []` и `filterable: true` → `InvalidAttributeConfig('filterable', ...)`; `usesChoices()` и пустые choices → `InvalidAttributeConfig`; не `usesChoices()` и непустые → `InvalidAttributeConfig`; неизвестный ключ типа → `UnsupportedContribution` (из `Contributions::get`).

Корень `Commerz\Catalog\Catalog` (`#[Api] final readonly`): `products(): Products`, `variants(): Variants`, `options(): Options`, `attributes(): Attributes`, `productTypes(): ProductTypes`, `categories(): Categories`, `listings(): Listings`. Фасад `Commerz\Catalog\Facades\Catalog` (accessor `Catalog::class`, `@method static` на каждый аксессор). Все ID — `final readonly class XId extends Commerz\Identity\EntityId` в `Data/`.

| Модуль | Контракт и методы | Команды/запросы (поля; конструктор валидирует форму) | Представления | Ошибки (code) | События |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Attributes | `define(DefineAttribute): AttributeView`, `update(UpdateAttribute): AttributeView`, `addChoices(AddAttributeChoices): AttributeView`, `find(AttributeId)`, `findByCode(string)`, `list(ListAttributes): Page<AttributeView>` | `DefineAttribute(code, type, LocalizedText name, array config = [], array<string, LocalizedText> choices = [], bool filterable = false)`; `UpdateAttribute(AttributeId attribute, ?LocalizedText name = null, ?bool filterable = null, ?AttributeStatus status = null, array<string, LocalizedText> choiceLabels = [])`; `AddAttributeChoices(AttributeId attribute, array<string, LocalizedText> choices)`; `ListAttributes(?string type = null, bool includeRetired = false, int first = 50, ?Cursor after = null)` по `code` | `AttributeView(id, code, type, name, config, configVersion, filterable, status, supported, list<AttributeChoiceView> choices, createdAt, updatedAt)`; `AttributeChoiceView(AttributeChoiceId id, code, LocalizedText label, int position)` | `attribute_not_found`, `duplicate_code`, `invalid_attribute_config`, `invalid_attribute_value`, `attribute_not_writable`, `attribute_not_allowed`, `attribute_not_filterable`, `missing_required_attributes`, `invalid_status_transition` | — |
| Options | `define(DefineOption)`, `addValues(AddOptionValues)`, `update(UpdateOption)`, `find(OptionId)`, `findByCode(string)`, `list(ListOptions)` → `OptionView` / `Page<OptionView>` | `DefineOption(code, LocalizedText name, array<string, LocalizedText> values)` (≥1 значение; порядок = position); `AddOptionValues(OptionId option, array<string, LocalizedText> values)`; `UpdateOption(OptionId option, ?LocalizedText name = null, array<string, LocalizedText> valueLabels = [])`; `ListOptions(int first = 50, ?Cursor after = null)` по `code` | `OptionView(id, code, name, list<OptionValueView> values, createdAt, updatedAt)`; `OptionValueView(OptionValueId id, code, LocalizedText label, int position)` | `option_not_found`, `duplicate_code`, `unknown_option_value` | — |
| ProductTypes | `create(CreateProductType)`, `update(UpdateProductType)`, `archive(ArchiveProductType)`, `find(ProductTypeId)`, `findByCode(string)`, `list(ListProductTypes)`; SPI `ProductKind` (`KIND = 'product_kind'`: `key()`, `sellableKind(): SellableKind`, `requiresShipping(): bool`) | `CreateProductType(code, LocalizedText name, string kind = 'physical', list<string> productAttributes = [], list<string> variantAttributes = [], list<string> variantAxes = [], list<string> required = [])`; `UpdateProductType(ProductTypeId type, ?LocalizedText name = null, list<string> addProductAttributes = [], list<string> addVariantAttributes = [])`; `ArchiveProductType(ProductTypeId type)`; `ListProductTypes(bool includeArchived = false, int first = 50, ?Cursor after = null)` | `ProductTypeView(id, code, name, kind, status, list<AttributeSlotView> slots, list<string> axes, createdAt, updatedAt)`; `AttributeSlotView(AttributeId attribute, string code, AttributeLevel level, bool required, int position)` | `product_type_not_found`, `product_type_archived`, `duplicate_code`, `invalid_product_type`, `too_many_axes` | — |
| Products | `create(CreateProduct)`, `update(UpdateProduct)`, `setAttributes(SetProductAttributes)`, `archive(ArchiveProduct)`, `find(ProductId)`, `findByHandle(string)`, `list(ListProducts): Page<ProductView>` | `CreateProduct(ProductTypeId type, string handle, LocalizedText name, ?LocalizedText description = null, array attributes = [], ProductStatus status = Active)`; `UpdateProduct(ProductId product, ?string handle = null, ?LocalizedText name = null, ?LocalizedText description = null, ?ProductStatus status = null)` (status только Draft/Active); `SetProductAttributes(ProductId product, array values = [], list<string> remove = [])`; `ArchiveProduct(ProductId product)`; `ListProducts(?ChannelId channel = null, ?ProductTypeId type = null, ?CategoryId category = null, ?ProductStatus status = null, list<AttributeFilter|VariantFilter> filters = [], ?DateTimeImmutable at = null, int first = 24, ?Cursor after = null)`; `AttributeFilter::equals(code, mixed)`, `::in(code, list)`, `::between(code, mixed min = null, mixed max = null)`; `VariantFilter::axes(array<string,string>)` | `ProductView(id, ProductTypeId type, handle, name, ?description, status, array<string,mixed> attributes, list<string> axes, createdAt, updatedAt)` | `product_not_found`, `product_archived`, `duplicate_code`, `invalid_handle`, `invalid_status_transition` + ошибки writer'а | `ProductCreated(ProductView)`, `ProductUpdated(ProductView)` (update, setAttributes, archive) |
| Variants | `create(CreateVariant)`, `generate(GenerateVariants): GeneratedVariants`, `update(UpdateVariant)`, `setAttributes(SetVariantAttributes)`, `archive(ArchiveVariant)`, `restore(RestoreVariant)`, `find(VariantId)`, `findBySku(string)`, `list(ListVariants): Page<VariantView>` | `CreateVariant(ProductId product, string sku, array<string,string> axes = [], ?string barcode = null, array attributes = [], ?string taxClass = null, ?int weightGrams = null, ?Dimensions dimensions = null, ?int position = null)`; `GenerateVariants(ProductId product, array<string, list<string>> axes, string skuPattern, list<array<string,string>> except = [], bool dryRun = false)`; `UpdateVariant(VariantId variant, ?string sku = null, ?string barcode = null, ?string taxClass = null, ?int weightGrams = null, ?Dimensions dimensions = null, ?int position = null, list<string> clear = [])` (`clear` ⊆ `barcode,taxClass,weightGrams,dimensions`); `SetVariantAttributes(VariantId variant, array values = [], list<string> remove = [])`; `ArchiveVariant(VariantId)`, `RestoreVariant(VariantId)`; `ListVariants(ProductId product, bool includeArchived = false, int first = 100, ?Cursor after = null)` по `(position, id)`; `Dimensions(int lengthMm, int widthMm, int heightMm)` ≥ 0 | `VariantView(id, ProductId product, sku, ?barcode, array<string,string> axes, status, position, array<string,mixed> attributes, ?taxClass, ?weightGrams, ?Dimensions dimensions, SellableRef sellable, createdAt, updatedAt)`; `GeneratedVariants`, `PlannedVariant` | `variant_not_found`, `duplicate_code`, `duplicate_combination`, `invalid_axes`, `too_many_variants`, `invalid_sku`, `invalid_sku_pattern`, `product_archived` | `VariantCreated(VariantView)`, `VariantUpdated(VariantView)` |
| Categories | `create(CreateCategory)`, `update(UpdateCategory)`, `move(MoveCategory)`, `archive(ArchiveCategory)`, `find(CategoryId)`, `findByCode(string)`, `list(ListCategories)`, `assign(AssignProductCategories): list<CategoryView>`, `ofProduct(ProductId): list<CategoryView>` | `CreateCategory(code, LocalizedText name, ?CategoryId parent = null, int position = 0)`; `UpdateCategory(CategoryId category, ?LocalizedText name = null, ?int position = null)`; `MoveCategory(CategoryId category, ?CategoryId parent)`; `ArchiveCategory(CategoryId)`; `ListCategories(?CategoryId parent = null, bool roots = false, bool includeArchived = false, int first = 100, ?Cursor after = null)` по `code` (keyset `Cursor::after($code)`); `parent` и `roots` взаимоисключающие; `AssignProductCategories(ProductId product, list<CategoryId> categories)` — заменяет набор | `CategoryView(id, ?CategoryId parent, code, name, position, status, createdAt, updatedAt)` | `category_not_found`, `duplicate_code`, `category_cycle`, `category_has_children`, `category_archived` | — |
| Listings | `publish(PublishProduct): ListingView`, `unpublish(UnpublishProduct): ListingView`, `find(ProductId, ChannelId): ListingView`, `ofProduct(ProductId): list<ListingView>` | `PublishProduct(ProductId product, ChannelId channel, ?DateTimeImmutable availableFrom = null, ?DateTimeImmutable availableUntil = null)` (until > from); `UnpublishProduct(ProductId product, ChannelId channel)` | `ListingView(ProductId product, ChannelId channel, ListingStatus status, ?availableFrom, ?availableUntil, createdAt, updatedAt)` | `listing_not_found`, `product_archived` + ядро `stores.channel_not_found`, `stores.channel_archived` | `ProductPublished(ListingView)`, `ProductUnpublished(ListingView)` |

Enums: `AttributeStatus(Active,Deprecated,Retired)`, `FilterOperator(Equals,In,Range)`, `AttributeLevel(Product,Variant)`, `ProductTypeStatus(Active,Archived)`, `ProductStatus(Draft,Active,Archived)`, `VariantStatus(Active,Archived)`, `CategoryStatus(Active,Archived)`, `ListingStatus(Published,Unpublished)` — backed string, значения = значения CHECK в схеме. Все коды ошибок — с префиксом `catalog.`.

Сквозной пример (тест P2.10, адаптирует blueprint к реальным именам):
```php
Catalog::options()->define(new DefineOption('color', LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Цвет'), ['red' => LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Красный'), 'blue' => LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Синий')]));
Catalog::options()->define(new DefineOption('size', LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Размер'), ['s' => LocalizedText::of('ru', 'S'), 'm' => LocalizedText::of('ru', 'M')]));   // коды — нижний регистр (CatalogCodes::code)
Catalog::attributes()->define(new DefineAttribute('material', 'enum', LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Материал'), choices: ['cotton' => LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Хлопок'), 'linen' => …], filterable: true));
Catalog::attributes()->define(new DefineAttribute('density', 'measure', LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Плотность'), config: ['unit' => 'gsm'], filterable: true));
$type = Catalog::productTypes()->create(new CreateProductType('apparel', LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Одежда'), productAttributes: ['material', 'density'], variantAxes: ['color', 'size']));
$product = Catalog::products()->create(new CreateProduct($type->id, 'basic-tee', LocalizedText::of('ru', 'Футболка'), attributes: ['material' => 'cotton', 'density' => Measure::of('180', 'gsm')]));
Catalog::variants()->generate(new GenerateVariants($product->id, ['color' => ['red', 'blue'], 'size' => ['s', 'm']], 'TEE-{color}-{size}', except: [['color' => 'blue', 'size' => 's']]));
Catalog::listings()->publish(new PublishProduct($product->id, $channel->id));
```
